xfce4-focus-plugin (0.4.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Revert the bold/colored scale-mark experiment (confirmed via a
    standalone test that GTK discards markup formatting on scale marks
    regardless of theme) and bring back the status label below the
    duration scale, now genuinely bold via Pango markup on a real
    GtkLabel, which isn't subject to that limitation.

