xfce4-focus-plugin (0.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the selected duration mark not visibly standing out: the
    active theme (Greybird) renders scale marks at ~40% opacity
    regardless of font weight, so bold alone was invisible. The
    selected mark's color is now explicitly overridden via Pango markup
    to the scale's normal (undimmed) text color, on top of bold.

