xfce4-focus-plugin (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rework activation: the checkboxes now only select which features to
    include, they no longer turn Stay Awake/Do Not Disturb on or off by
    themselves. Activation happens by clicking the main panel button or
    the dropdown's Ok button; deactivation happens by clicking the main
    button again or when the selected duration elapses.

